4. Advertising signs or banners at athletic fields with the approval of the director of
parks and recreation.
5. A low-profile sign may include an Electronic Message Center in accordance with the
following limitations:
a. Electronic message centers may comprise up to 15% of the total allowed sign
area. Electronic Message Centers for Entertainment Venues with greater than
1,000 seats may comprise up to 50% of the total allowed sign area.
